# how to run

CD into this example directory, and run `../../RUNME.sh` and it should use the .env in your current directory

# How To Use This Example

Configure both .envs with your media directories

1. Rename .env.video1 to .env and RUNME that, then rename it back so you can do the next.
2. Rename .env.video2 to .env and RUNME that - this ENV file has the merging configured
